#. macro: <string $gs1> — a text value passed to the string; value = global text 1 (the name of the player character) (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "quest/034/LucKzc103_03406:TEXT_LUCKZC103_03406_ULTHON_000_075:1"
msgid "You heard them, <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split>! We have to help Hagan Nee, else they'll become fiend fodder!"
msgstr ""
